From 13fa98f69b7bbc492637b2c0fb7c8fad0ae737e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lunatickochiya <125438787@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:08:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] ci: keep only Docker and Release workflows for the fork

Replace the upstream release/devtool workflows with two self-contained
workflows:
- docker.yml builds the server and ML cpu/rknn images and pushes them to
  the fork owner's GHCR
- release.yml builds the Android APK and publishes a GitHub release

Fork-only: do not send this patch upstream.
